@startuml unlock-and-print
!include ../diagram-style.puml
' docs/architecture.md §6.2: unlocking and printing.
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "PrintoutController" as P
participant "PrintoutService" as S
participant "UnlockService" as X
participant "PaymentProvider (Stripe)" as Pay
participant "renderForms (pdf-lib)" as R

U -> P : GET …/:jahr/ausdruck/pruefung
P --> U : pre-check: what is missing, what will be printed
U -> P : POST …/:jahr/ausdruck/checkout
P -> S : startCheckout
S -> X : create checkout
X -> Pay : createCheckout
Pay --> U : redirect to the Stripe checkout
Pay -> X : POST /v1/zahlung/stripe/webhook
X -> Pay : verifyEvent (signature)
note over X : unlock stored for user and tax year
U -> P : GET …/:jahr/ausdruck
P -> S : assemble the values
S -> R : renderForms
R --> U : PDF: main form and the annexes needed
@enduml
